# Oracle re-run in tmp/oracle_merge3, against tmp/oracle_merged2 (the previous merge's run), line by line:
# - defaults comparable (7,509 records), windows.sorted, windows.histograms: main's 5bfcecbf / e1c72672 / b2fc1bfa, as
