# 19 in the SNP/indel tables (33 numbers), the largest move 2.9e-8 of its value; 100 in the repeat-tract tables fitted
# afterwards from them (1,276 numbers), the largest 5.3e-5 of its value. from_fit.comparable (7aeeff78 -> a872e3b6): only
# `##pvcParameters`, carrying the fitted file's new md5; no record, QUAL or genotype moves. They were 266836a0 / 7aeeff78.
